#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:2 ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:6
msgid "PS5520 5MP HDR Camera"
msgstr "Camera PS5520 5MP HDR"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:4
msgid ""
"The PS5520 is a 5MP HDR sensor with PixArt's FinePixel and HDR pipelines, "
"designed for scenes with challenging dynamic range."
msgstr ""
"La PS5520 è un sensore HDR da 5MP con le pipeline FinePixel e HDR di PixArt,"
" progettato per scene con gamma dinamica impegnativa."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `PS5520 5MP HDR Camera "
"product page <https://openmv.io/products/ps5520-5mp-hdr-camera-module>`_."
msgstr ""
"Per il datasheet completo, le foto e le informazioni d'ordine, consulta la "
"`pagina prodotto PS5520 5MP HDR Camera "
"<https://openmv.io/products/ps5520-5mp-hdr-camera-module>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:16
msgid "Supported on the OpenMV N6 only."
msgstr "Supportato solo sulla OpenMV N6."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Punti salienti"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:21
msgid "5MP (2592x1944) at 30 FPS in HDR mode"
msgstr "5MP (2592x1944) a 30 FPS in modalità HDR"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:22
msgid "Single-shot HDR with 85 dB dynamic range, 39 dB SNR"
msgstr "HDR a scatto singolo con gamma dinamica di 85 dB, SNR di 39 dB"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:25
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilizzo"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:27
msgid "On the N6 the frame rate is set by the MJPEG VENC encoder."
msgstr "Sulla N6 il frame rate è impostato dall'encoder MJPEG VENC."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:29
msgid "Stream a 30 FPS HDR color video at 1280x720 (HD) in RGB565::"
msgstr "Trasmetti un video a colori HDR a 30 FPS a 1280x720 (HD) in RGB565::"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:45
msgid "Stream a 15 FPS HDR color video at 1920x1080 (FHD) in RGB565::"
msgstr ""
"Trasmetti un video a colori HDR a 15 FPS a 1920x1080 (FHD) in RGB565::"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ps5520.rst:61
msgid ""
"Stream a 5 FPS HDR color video at full 5MP — 2592x1944 (WQXGA2) — in "
"RGB565::"
msgstr ""
"Trasmetti un video a colori HDR a 5 FPS a piena risoluzione 5MP — 2592x1944 "
"(WQXGA2) — in RGB565::"
